            "review_title": "Review at Le' House Charcoal Grilled And Wine",
            "review_text": "Rodney S\nPhuket, Thailand19 contributions\n0\nGreat new restaurant on Hon Chong Rd.\nMay 2022\nWe discovered this restaurant quite by accident, so glad we did. The food, the service, the ambiance are all top level quality. I had a delicious pasta dish while my wife enjoyed the Striploin cooked to perfection. Le' House has a very nice selection of wine and beer, as well. The restaurant is within La Paloma Villa, serving within a leafy courtyard. Le' House is the kind of place you go to again and again. Five stars all around.\nRead more\nValue\nService\nFood\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten May 6, 2022",
